      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A novel monoterpenoid indole alkaloid with unprecedented 6/5/6/4/6 fused rings, khasuanine A (1), was isolated from the roots of Melodinus khasianus. The structure was determined by extensive analysis of its HR-MS, 1D-, and 2D-NMR spectra. Khasuanine A markedly inhibited the proliferation of PC3 cell with IC50 value of 0.45μM. Further study showed that khasuanine A was able to induce the apoptosis of PC3 cells by activation of caspase 3 and p53, and by inhibition of Bcl-2."
      },
